32032.a:
```groovy
pipeline {
  agent { label 'linux' }
  environment { GO111MODULE = 'on' }
  stages {
    stage('Build') { steps { sh 'go build ./...' } }
    stage('Test')  { steps { sh 'go test ./...' } }
  }
  post {
    always  { junit 'report.xml' }
    failure { echo 'fail' }
  }
}
```

`post` bloklari: `always`, `success`, `failure`, `unstable`, `cleanup`.

