32035.a:
- Branch o'chirilsa job ham o'chadi (orphan strategy).
- PR uchun: `CHANGE_ID`, `CHANGE_TARGET` env.
- `when { branch 'main' }` — faqat main'da deploy:

```groovy
stage('Deploy') {
  when { branch 'main' }
  steps { sh './deploy.sh' }
}
```

Xavf: fork PR'dagi `Jenkinsfile` o'zgarishi — "Trusted" sozlamasi bilan faqat ishonchli contributor Jenkinsfile'i ishlatiladi.

32037.a:
```groovy
stage('Build') { steps { sh 'make'; stash name: 'bin', includes: 'dist/**' } }
stage('Tests') {
  parallel {
    stage('unit') { agent any; steps { unstash 'bin'; sh 'make unit' } }
    stage('e2e')  { agent any; steps { unstash 'bin'; sh 'make e2e' } }
  }
}
```

- Stash controller orqali o'tadi — katta fayl uchun sekin va controller'ni yuklaydi; katta narsalar uchun artifact repo (Nexus/S3).
- `failFast true` — bitta fail qolganini to'xtatadi.

