33057.a:
```groovy
stage('Deploy') {
  when {
    beforeAgent true
    allOf {
      branch 'main'
      not { changeRequest() }
      changeset 'services/billing/**'
    }
  }
  steps { sh './deploy.sh' }
}
```

`beforeAgent` bo'lmasa shart false bo'lsa ham agent/pod ajratiladi — vaqt va resurs isrofi.

